{
  "name": "timeout_demo",
  "version": "1",
  "description": "按 AC 配 limits 的自证脚本：max_timeout_ms=300，循环体用 rdd_get_inventory（服务端直读背包，不走监听器，不会被连发打断）。跑到 wall-clock 熔断就该出 TIMEOUT。",
  "tags": [
    "demo",
    "timeout"
  ],
  "planner_notes": "limits 逐项覆盖全局；没写的键沿用全局。三键：max_steps / max_timeout_ms / max_depth。",
  "safety_notes": "只读背包 + 登记说明，不移动、不放置、不攻击。",
  "limits": {
    "max_steps": 100000,
    "max_timeout_ms": 300
  },
  "steps": [
    {
      "id": "loop",
      "block": "while",
      "params": {
        "condition": {
          "field": "$input.keep",
          "op": "==",
          "value": true
        },
        "max_iters": 100000,
        "stagnant_limit": 1000000
      },
      "children": [
        {
          "id": "tick",
          "block": "rdd_get_inventory",
          "params": {}
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
